Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.46,0:00:04.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a job!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.54,0:00:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.79,0:00:09.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm serious, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.46,0:00:13.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,WHAT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:29.83,Song,,0,0,0,,My eyes were opened up wide
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.83,0:00:34.79,Song,,0,0,0,,By a scene that rent my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.21,0:00:37.79,Song,,0,0,0,,See it flitting, flitting through the gaps in your fingers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:40.42,Song,,0,0,0,,Stare at the truth as it comes into view
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:45.38,Song,,0,0,0,,Is what's been built here paradise?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:49.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Tumbling down head over heels
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:53.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know this might be a wasteland
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.04,0:01:00.33,Song,,0,0,0,,But I have to land so I can survive on my own
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:01.50,Song,,0,0,0,,I have to go now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:05.17,Song,,0,0,0,,I vomited up magificent blood
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.17,0:01:11.58,Song,,0,0,0,,That these flowers I planted here might bloom eternal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.58,0:01:17.04,Song,,0,0,0,,I love this hopeless world enough to give
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:23.13,Song,,0,0,0,,All that my lungs and my legs and my hands have to give for it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:30.17,Song,,0,0,0,,And I swear I'll find a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.17,0:01:36.17,Song,,0,0,0,,That was worth all this sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.63,0:01:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You once asked for a mission
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.54,0:01:51.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,with specific characteristics,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:53.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I finally found you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.75,0:01:54.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.96,0:01:55.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:58.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You said you wanted something with\Nlittle danger to life and limb,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.04,0:02:01.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but one that would build experience nonetheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:04.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, right, I did, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:13.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is just grunt work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.13,0:02:17.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why bother calling me all the way out here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:20.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,just to give me an odd job\Nno harder than a spy academy drill?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:23.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So you would owe me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.21,0:02:40.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Did she memorize everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:43.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,She must have looked through my window,\Nremembered the locations of every item in the room,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:47.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,then took the traps she triggered when she snuck in\Nand reset them to their original positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.92,0:02:49.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:51.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've improved your skills, Annette.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.63,0:02:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been found, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:56.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was this for training?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.79,0:02:58.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or did you have something you wanted to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:03:00.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want some spending money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:06.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was buying parts for this machine I'm building,\Nbut then my wages ran out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.96,0:03:11.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The mission completion bonuses that get deposited\Ninto your account are fairly substantial.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:13.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I want more!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.67,0:03:20.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette, what would you say to taking on a side job?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a job!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:33.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Teach, what's this about Annette getting a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.79,0:03:35.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a simple infiltration mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:36.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.83,0:03:38.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Two years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.46,0:03:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,an enemy spy was dealing drugs out of\Nthe restaurant Annette's going to be working at.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.00,0:03:44.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The matter's long since been settled,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.88,0:03:48.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but we need to make sure the shop's\Nback on the straight and narrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.46,0:03:52.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I suggested that she spend the next two weeks\Nworking there as her cover,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.38,0:03:57.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and when I told her she could keep the wages\Nshe earned, she happily accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.83,0:04:01.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-that all makes sense,\Nbut are you sure this is a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:06.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Forget working, Annette can't even\Nhandle her chores right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:10.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When I told her to wash the windows the other day,\Nshe blew the whole damn frame off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.25,0:04:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I asked her to get us some vegetables,\Nand she started planting seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.79,0:04:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She did the laundry, and everything\Nended up covered in sequins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:22.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Feels like she's gonna mix blasting powder\Ninto the restaurant's food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.38,0:04:24.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or build a weapon right in the middle of the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:29.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think things are going to be nearly as bad\Nas you're making them out to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.67,0:04:33.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but it would be a good idea to have\Nat least two people watching over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.38,0:04:34.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:40.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nooooooo!\N{\rSubtitle-3}Yeeeeeeep!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:43.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got another mission, so I won't be helping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.25,0:04:47.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.25,0:04:52.67,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Bluhhhhh...\N{\rSubtitle}Yeeeeeep...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.79,0:04:57.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what the hell's goin' on at that restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:05:00.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bluhhhhh...\N{\rSubtitle-3}Yeeeeeep...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.83,0:05:05.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I worked hard today, so I'm gonna drink some milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:14.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm off to work, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:17.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bluhhhhh...\N{\rSubtitle-3}Yeeeeeep...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:19.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-have a nice day...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That settles it.\NNo way we're goin' near that restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.21,0:05:27.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Agreed, my life is too precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:30.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shit gives me the chills.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:43.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:45.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your soul will end up screaming "bluhhhhh"!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.25,0:05:47.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're just going to check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:49.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Should be worth a solid laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.17,0:05:52.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Simple or not, the boss entrusted us with this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.71,0:05:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to slack off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:59.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's Monika and Grete we're talkin' about.\NMaybe they'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:01.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I certainly hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:02.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gahhhhh...\N{\rSubtitle-3}Urrrrrrgh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:11.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go take a bath to scrub off the grime\Nfrom how hard I worked, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.21,0:06:26.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-it's just up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:28.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I say we turn back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.29,0:06:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want to end up turning into a bluhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:31.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or an urrrrrrgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.83,0:06:33.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or a gluhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.67,0:06:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, nobody's gone "gluhhhhh" yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We gotta find out what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.79,0:06:42.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At this rate, Lamplight's gonna get wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:45.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.96,0:06:59.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:02.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have your grilled chicken and shrimp fritters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.75,0:07:04.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.67,0:07:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:12.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hello there!\NHave you decided on your order?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.29,0:07:18.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Chef, table two is gonna be\Na chickpea salad with no pepper,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.96,0:07:22.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,garlic toast, a large sirloin pasta,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:24.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and they asked to get their coffee\Nonce they’re done with their entrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.75,0:07:27.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Also, table four still needs their tomato soup,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:31.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and table twenty-two needs their cheesecake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.54,0:07:35.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Manager, I went ahead and fixed that\Ntap with the wonky flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:40.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I used my special sprayer to clean up\Nthe graffiti in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:45.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, mister, welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:48.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Will you be having the usual today?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:57.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,WE NEED TO SPEAK WITH HER GUARDIAN!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.71,0:08:00.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:06.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's well within Miss Annette's\Ncapabilities, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.25,0:08:08.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, what're you talkin' about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:09.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.71,0:08:13.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a little difficult to explain,\Nbut it all boils down to how motivated she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.75,0:08:16.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How motivated she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:17.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:19.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's always been brimming with potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.83,0:08:23.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's super smart, and while she\Nmight not show it, she's really adaptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:28.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But the thing is, and I'm not sure I'm putting it\Nvery well, the issue is with her attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.79,0:08:31.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she is pretty damn free-spirited.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.33,0:08:36.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whenever she's got her mind set on somethin',\Nit's like nothin' else even registers to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:38.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In other words, all that talent is just wasted on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.71,0:08:42.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know that if you ask right,\Nshe can do chores just fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:45.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She has a hangup about her height,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:48.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so she loves it when you give her\Ndairy products as a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.58,0:08:49.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:52.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She did seem kind of torn up\Nabout how she wasn't getting taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:54.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't it adorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.75,0:08:58.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure you're the only one who sees it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.21,0:09:00.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:14.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's probably responsible for\Nloads of the foot traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:16.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gotta say, I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.75,0:09:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.75,0:09:20.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It makes me realize how shallow I was being.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.46,0:09:24.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes? How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.08,0:09:32.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This glass is dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.96,0:09:35.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go get me a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.25,0:09:36.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That four-eyed piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:38.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait! Have some faith in Annette.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:42.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But like...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:52.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll get you that replacement right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:02.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn, she even knows how\Nto deal with problem customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:05.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the service industry for you, sadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.46,0:10:09.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No matter how well you do your job,\Nthere's just no pleasing some people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:12.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm impressed she was able to\Nkeep it professional there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I woulda just punched him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.46,0:10:17.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder what she needs the money for, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.42,0:10:22.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Actually, Miss Annette came to me\Nfor advice the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:26.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"What kind of present would Klaus like?" she asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean, she's workin' to buy a gift for Klaus?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.96,0:10:33.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm learning all sorts of new things about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.75,0:10:41.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Also, is it just me, or are her lookouts\Nnot gettin' any of their work done?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.25,0:10:43.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And they said they wanted\Ntheir free coffee after the entrée...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:45.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:47.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got our order wrong again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:49.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.17,0:10:50.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.33,0:10:56.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:11:00.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that we've solved the mystery of the bwuhhhhhs,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.21,0:11:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we should get back to worrying about the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.04,0:11:03.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How's the infiltration going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.79,0:11:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Have you noticed anything out of the ordinary?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.21,0:11:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One thing that's suspicious is how\Nmy body hasn't been moving right lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:13.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I spent all day falling over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:19.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,\Nthe bathroom got covered in graffiti again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.33,0:11:21.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And right after Annette cleaned it all off, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.92,0:11:24.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I copied it all down, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:26.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Hardened Tower"...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:28.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Dangling Hero"...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if those are some sort of religious symbols?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"My Long-Range Missile Cannon"\Nand "Bulging Doohickey" go,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.33,0:11:38.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,those could be some sort of\Nsecret weapons they're developing in-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.67,0:11:40.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just slang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:41.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those are all terms for male genitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.67,0:11:44.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you let me say them all out loud?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.25,0:11:51.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It is strange how they reappeared in force\Nimmediately after being erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:54.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could it be a code, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.17,0:12:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They told me they knew how\NI could get rich, and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.71,0:12:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And these goods are choice, see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.13,0:12:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:34.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's dried cannabis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:36.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go put it back where you found it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:39.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but first, slip a transmitter into the pouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.92,0:12:48.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I found the guy who took the pouches.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.79,0:12:51.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, they're using the toilet\Nas a dropsite for drug deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:57.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He says that the prices and amounts for sale\Nget written on the wall each weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.92,0:13:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, the customers leave behind money\Nand write how much they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:05.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A Hardened Tower is one bag,\Na Dangling Hero is two bags...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You get the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.71,0:13:11.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Later, someone leaves the pot behind in the tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.38,0:13:12.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.58,0:13:14.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did he see your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:15.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:18.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got a master of disguise with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.33,0:13:19.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take a hike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.83,0:13:36.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, that means we should keep an eye on\Nanyone who goes to the bathroom a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.58,0:13:38.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are two patrons that seem suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:41.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sybilla, I'll take the man by the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.04,0:13:44.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You take the man by the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:45.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.00,0:13:51.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Pandemonium,\Nand it's time I cleaned 'em out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.79,0:13:55.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Dreamspeaker,\Nand it's time to lure them to their ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:13:59.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.79,0:14:02.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I checked his bag, but it was empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:04.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's not our dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.13,0:14:05.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My target was clean, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:08.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I leaned against him and peered in his heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:10.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I didn't sense any dastardly desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.25,0:14:13.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-you two are incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The people we need to be looking at are the staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.46,0:14:23.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.83,0:14:27.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.54,0:14:32.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Go inspect the storeroom."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.63,0:14:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Manager, can we take our breaks now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.54,0:14:38.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You may not!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:41.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how many plates\Nthe two of you have broken?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:43.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!\N{\rSubtitle-3}Yeep?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.33,0:14:45.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Manager, things are pretty slow\Non the floor right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.58,0:14:47.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I'm going to go double-check our inventory!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:50.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, how thoughtful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:52.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and take those two with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.38,0:14:54.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right! I'm off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.38,0:14:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-the way she treats us is like night and day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.33,0:15:08.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Found 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.63,0:15:11.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, this locker belongs to-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-you found them...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.13,0:15:17.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.33,0:15:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.83,0:15:22.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now I have to k-k-kill you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:25.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.42,0:15:29.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I need the money for Mom's surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.63,0:15:31.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Without that weed, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:35.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-someone figured out you needed money\Nand asked you to be their middleman, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:37.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:38.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.29,0:15:41.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We only ever communicated by letters\Nand over the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:46.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so done for, I-I-I need to kill you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.83,0:15:48.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.83,0:15:50.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is for my mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.67,0:15:52.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:54.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but there are some things you just can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.88,0:15:57.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can atone for your crimes in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.29,0:16:02.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Double yeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.04,0:16:12.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, did Erna die on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:16.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:20.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I told you my body hasn't been\Nlistening to me lately!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:23.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I learned something today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.04,0:16:31.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hm? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.71,0:16:34.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Making money is hard work, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.67,0:16:38.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The way it ended leaves a bit of\Na bad taste in my mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.25,0:16:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but we finished the investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:41.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our mission is complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.25,0:16:42.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:47.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they were dealin'\Nout of the restaurant again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.33,0:16:50.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They were probably doing it\Nto fund their operations,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.21,0:16:52.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but still, that's a bold move for\Nan Imperial spy to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.83,0:16:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't stand the way the culprit
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.92,0:17:00.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,took advantage of the pure way\Nthat young man cared about his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.29,0:17:01.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.33,0:17:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And when I think about not just him,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.13,0:17:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but all the people in the city whose lives\Nwill be ruined by that cannabis,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.63,0:17:11.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it really does boil my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.38,0:17:13.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Feels like we left the job only half-finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.79,0:17:16.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel,\Nbut discretion is the better part of valor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:18.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From here on out, it's another team's job to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.96,0:17:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll put a group of\Nspecialists on the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:25.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, that was easy as pie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:27.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By day, she's a lovable waitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.67,0:17:31.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But by night, she's a secret agent\Nwho cracks down on drugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.54,0:17:35.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's Lily, pride and joy of the Republic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.67,0:17:38.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You sound even more full of yourself than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.13,0:17:39.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.71,0:17:43.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It hurts to admit it, but we all know\Nwho the star player was this time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.04,0:17:47.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, yo, are you talking about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.67,0:17:48.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:51.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had you pegged all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:55.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've got enough talent to\Nmake the rest of us feel jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:57.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're an amazing spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was wondering who it was,\Nbut it's you, from the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.29,0:18:35.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What, are you bitter that I threw my rum at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.21,0:18:38.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Planning on hitting me with your umbrella, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:45.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you want to try, then by all means, be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty put out myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:52.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be if you hadn't erased\Nthat graffiti, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:55.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I needed it in order to make the money from my-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:03.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn you, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.38,0:19:05.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're in the same business I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.38,0:19:07.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dammit, if I could only see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:14.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:16.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.54,0:19:17.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How could you have known?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.54,0:19:21.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I stuck the transmitter on you\N'cause I was pissed, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.88,0:19:22.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.88,0:19:28.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You put a tracker on me because\Nyou were mad I threw my booze at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The fact you're attacking me\Nfor being a spy is just a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.17,0:19:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, wait, you put trackers on\Nall your problem customers
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:40.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so you're ready to kill them whenever you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:45.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Forgetter,\Nand it's time to put it all together, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.75,0:19:48.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're deranged!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:52.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not how sane people behave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:55.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.63,0:19:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.42,0:20:07.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.29,0:20:10.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.75,0:20:12.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you doing this to protect the restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:14.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:16.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The whole place is closing down for\Nthe day tomorrow because of this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:20.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just for the record,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.00,0:20:24.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,eliminating problem customers isn't part of\Nthe waitress job description.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.75,0:20:27.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had no idea, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.96,0:20:31.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was some good work you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:33.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here's your next mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:36.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're a real slavedriver, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.13,0:20:38.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the mission you've been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:40.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For real, this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.46,0:20:46.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I figured out why I've been\Nfalling down all the time lately!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I got taller!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.25,0:20:51.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why my clothes were so tight\Nand hard to move around in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.29,0:20:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm finally hitting my growth spurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.46,0:20:55.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.92,0:20:57.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.00,0:21:04.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the wages from my job,\Nit's finally finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.00,0:21:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I call it the Erna Shaving Apparatus!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.13,0:21:09.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna use it to file down her skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.29,0:21:15.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh hey, Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here's a bribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.75,0:21:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please go ahead and turn a blind eye here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.71,0:21:22.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what the present was for?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.92,0:21:27.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Erna! We're gonna use my machine to\Ntake off that new height of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.42,0:21:30.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-the look in her eyes says she's not joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.25,0:21:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeeeeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.71,0:21:36.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't get to leave me behind and\Nhave a growth spurt all on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.00,0:23:10.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've been given our next mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.21,0:23:13.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After we took Corpse alive, he started talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.25,0:23:16.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, we know where Serpent is lurking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:20.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So? Who you pickin' to come along?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.46,0:23:24.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:28.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The nine of us are going to figure out\Nwho Serpent really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.79,0:23:32.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This mission is going to involve\Ninfiltrating a foreign country.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.42,0:23:35.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Serpent is hiding in the United States of Mouzaia,\Nover in the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.17,0:23:39.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is going to be a major trial for all of you.
